  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of Protection Assistance Including Humanitarian Evacuation for Stranded Ethiopian Migrants and Assisted Spontaneous Return ror Somali Refugees in Yemen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through the project, IOM will also ensure that Ethiopian Migrants and Somali refugees have access to protection assistance through ensuring humane and dignified return for stranded migrants and refugees to Somalia and Ethiopia. IOM will continue to actively engage with all stakeholders including authorities, UNHCR, other UN agencies, international non-governmental organizations (INGOs) and non-governmental organizations (NGOs) to coordinate on the activities provided and ensure no duplications of assistance to vulnerable and destitute migrants.</narrative>
  </description>
